# Bassidi Kone Cafe Le Monde, Noosa

## Malian World Music Tour

[![Bassidi Kone Cafe Le Monde](/media/2013/06/Bassidi-Kone-flyer.jpg)](/drumming-workshops/bassidi-kone-flyer/) Bassidi Kone Malian World Music TOUR @ Cafe Le Monde, Noosa Friday July 12th 6pm Don't miss this awesome event with Bassidi Kone from Mali, West Africa and Sunshine Coast's Nathaniel Combs. If you like to dance and listen to world class music performed by Master African drummer, Bassidi Kone then this is the gig for you! Get ready to get your groove on and be blown away by this special one off event at Cafe Le Monde! DRUM ON! Friday July 12th 6pm @ Cafe Le Monde, Noosa
